WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.690
TopoMarket visualizes market structure and tests whether topology can warn of sharp declines.

2
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:10.275
These twelve industry portfolios contrast two market regimes.

3
00:00:10.295 --> 00:00:14.590
Watch how the network becomes far more connected under stress.

4
00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:20.806
Explore the relationships directly.

5
00:00:20.826 --> 00:00:25.078
Mapper connects groups that share industry portfolios.

6
00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:32.313
A separate indicator studies the shape of recent S&amp;P 500 returns.

7
00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:35.734
This percentile measures unusual behavior.

8
00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:41.451
Now test the warning without hindsight.

9
00:00:41.471 --> 00:00:43.442
Reveal the next twenty sessions.

10
00:00:43.462 --> 00:00:49.434
The decline had already begun, and the next twenty sessions did not reach the ten percent target.

11
00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:54.610
Forecasting remains experimental; compare it with the simpler benchmarks.

12
00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:58.602
Explore the code and the live demo on GitHub.
